{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:776deaa14fc18345","name":"Droid Codex","source":{"id":"source:reference-776deaa14fc18345","title":"Droid Codex","revision":24568,"timestamp":"2024-11-03T20:28:48Z","sha256":"90fb69b17b5c72b7785dc4798befa1ed2c9d2e94bfb3b3cb570e1180d4557768","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24568","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Droid%20Codex&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-776deaa14fc18345","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," present in the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Star Wars"]}," universe is enough to make one's head spin, for the sheer number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Models"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Models"}," alone could fill a Datapad's memory banks, and these ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," contribute to almost every facet of galactic society. With numerous manufacturing companies continually designing and building new lines of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," as well as improving existing models, this industry has no end in sight.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This chapter, aptly named the Droid Codex, features a sampling of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," from various periods of the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Star Wars"]}," timeline that are newly written for the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Star Wars Roleplaying Game"]},". Each ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," presented has its own full entry that includes a statistics block, a description, a background, and an illustration. Although each entry is typically for the stock version of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},", any number of variants can exist and might reasonably be encountered, depending on the interests of the Gamemaster and the players. Each ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," also includes a statistics block for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Protocol Format"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Protocol_Format"},". Gamemasters who are using the optional protocol rules can give the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Protocol Format"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Protocol_Format"}," statistics block to the player who owns the Droid for quick reference.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Each ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," entry also includes a \"Playing the Droid\" sidebar, which includes a number of details about the construction and design of that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},". This area contains not only information about how to recreate the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," from scratch using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," construction rules and new equipment from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Equipment","referenceId":"reference:f323cd02fcdeacdc"},", it also includes tips on how to properly portray the Droid's personality according to the data presented in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Heroes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Heroes"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Allies"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Allies","referenceId":"reference:57e013dc0dd72927"}," of this book.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The entries in this chapter indicate a number of modifications that Gamemasters can implement, letting the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," perform other functions not normally performed by stock models. These modifications might be mechanical upgrades or parts replacements that allow the Droid to undertake new tasks and provide some interesting twists and surprises during game play. These modifications can also serve as inspiration for developing your own variants of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In addition to the information listed above, each entry also contains a sidebar feature that provides additional background information about the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," and offers an adventure seed for an adventure revolving around that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},", to help the Gamemaster introduce the new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," into the game.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Droid Models"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DROID\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TYPE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["PLAYABLE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["IMAGE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["88-Series Administration Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/88-Series_Administration_Droid"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["1st-Degree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/1st-Degree"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"